# Fire Nation Palace: "This land enters tapped unless you control a basic land." Bot1's Palace is its first land, so it enters
# tapped (checked as it enters, before Bot1's untap step); Bot2 plays a Mountain (a basic land) on turn 2 and its own Palace on
# turn 4, which enters untapped (the positive control: the same land, but a basic land Bot2 controls, CR 614.1d, 205.4a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Fire Nation Palace
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Fire Nation Palace
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Fire Nation Palace.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Fire Nation Palace.Tapped = true
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Fire Nation Palace.Play

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Fire Nation Palace.Tapped = false
